{"ticker":"MRPL","symbol":"MRPL","instrumentId":3023054,"name":"Mangalore Refinery","industry":"NSE-Oil&Gas-Refining/Mktg","about":"Mangalore Refinery & Petrochemicals Ltd. (MRPL) is a key player in India’s refining and petrochemical sectors, processing crude oil into high-quality petroleum products such as diesel, petrol, aviation fuel, and liquefied petroleum gas (LPG). Operating one of the most advanced refineries in India, MRPL has a refining capacity of over 15 million metric tons per annum. The company also produces valuable petrochemical products, including polypropylene, catering to both domestic and international markets. MRPL is committed to sustainable practices, focusing on energy efficiency and environmental compliance. As a subsidiary of Oil and Natural Gas Corporation (ONGC), MRPL is a major contributor to India's energy needs.","website":"www.mrpl.co.in","location":"Mangalore, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:39:19.968Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":176.18,"changePct":0.11933852361198384,"week52High":206.77,"week52Low":139.2},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹30,877 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹1,19,432 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"192,785,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"162"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"52,415,563"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"3.97%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"2.18"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.4"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"60.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.06"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.01"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"0%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"6.99"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"2–498"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"13.6%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"14.44"},{"label":"Volume","value":"2,199,421"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"14,130,847"},{"label":"Master score","value":"63"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"68"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"64"},{"label":"Group rank